<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Salary Structure &amp; Candidate Database</title>
<style>
  :root{
    --ink:#1c2530; --ink-soft:#5b6b7a; --paper:#f4f6f8; --card:#ffffff; --line:#dfe5ea;
    --navy:#1f3a5f; --navy-deep:#152a45; --teal:#0f7a72; --teal-soft:#e5f3f1;
    --amber:#b3781c; --amber-soft:#fbf1e2; --red:#b3402f; --red-soft:#fbeae7;
    --violet:#5b4b9e; --violet-soft:#efeafb;
    --mono: "SFMono-Regular", Consolas, "Liberation Mono", Menlo, monospace;
  }
  *{box-sizing:border-box;}
  body{ margin:0; background:var(--paper); color:var(--ink); font-family:"Segoe UI", Roboto, Arial, sans-serif; font-size:14px; line-height:1.45; }
  header.app-header{ background:var(--navy-deep); color:#fff; padding:16px 28px; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:10px; }
  header.app-header h1{ font-size:17px; margin:0; font-weight:600; }
  header.app-header .sub{ font-size:11.5px; color:#b9c6d6; margin-top:2px; }
  nav.tabs{ display:flex; gap:6px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  nav.tabs button{ background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.25); color:#dbe4ee; padding:7px 13px; border-radius:6px; cursor:pointer; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:600; }
  nav.tabs button.active{ background:var(--teal); border-color:var(--teal); color:#fff; }
  nav.tabs button:hover:not(.active){ background:rgba(255,255,255,.08); }

  main{ max-width:1340px; margin:0 auto; padding:22px 24px 60px; }
  .page{ display:none; } .page.active{ display:block; }

  .grid{ display:grid; grid-template-columns: 380px 1fr; gap:20px; align-items:start; }
  @media (max-width: 920px){ .grid{ grid-template-columns:1fr; } }

  .card{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:18px 20px; margin-bottom:18px; }
  .card h2{ font-size:13px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.6px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:0 0 14px; font-weight:700; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); padding-bottom:8px; display:flex; justify-content:space-between; align-items:center;}
  label{ display:block; font-size:11.5px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-soft); margin:10px 0 4px; }
  label:first-of-type{ margin-top:0; }
  input[type=text], input[type=number], input[type=date], select{ width:100%; padding:7px 9px; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:6px; font-size:13px; background:#fbfcfd; color:var(--ink); font-family:inherit; }
  input:focus, select:focus{ outline:2px solid var(--teal); outline-offset:1px; border-color:var(--teal); }
  .row2{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr; gap:10px; }
  .row3{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr; gap:10px; }
  .hint{ font-size:11px; color:#8592a0; margin-top:3px; }
  .chk{ display:flex; align-items:center; gap:6px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-top:10px;}
  .chk input{ width:auto; }

  .btn{ display:inline-block; background:var(--teal); color:#fff; border:none; padding:9px 15px; border-radius:6px; font-weight:700; font-size:12.5px; cursor:pointer; }
  .btn:hover{ background:#0c645d; }
  .btn.secondary{ background:transparent; color:var(--navy); border:1px solid var(--line); }
  .btn.secondary:hover{ background:#eef2f5; }
  .btn.danger{ background:transparent; color:var(--red); border:1px solid var(--red-soft); }
  .btn.danger:hover{ background:var(--red-soft); }
  .btn.small{ padding:4px 9px; font-size:11.5px; }
  .btn[disabled]{ opacity:.5; cursor:not-allowed; }

  .banner{ border-radius:8px; padding:11px 14px; font-size:12.5px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .banner.ok{ background:var(--teal-soft); color:#0c554f; border:1px solid #c7e6e2; }
  .banner.warn{ background:var(--amber-soft); color:#7a5011; border:1px solid #edd7ad; }
  .banner.bad{ background:var(--red-soft); color:#7a2c1f; border:1px solid #edc4bb; }
  .banner b{ font-weight:700; }

  table.calc{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13px; }
  table.calc th, table.calc td{ padding:6px 10px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); text-align:right; }
  table.calc th:first-child, table.calc td:first-child{ text-align:left; }
  table.calc thead th{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:10.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; border-bottom:2px solid var(--line); }
  table.calc tbody tr.section td{ background:#f7f9fa; font-weight:700; color:var(--navy); padding-top:10px; }
  table.calc tbody tr.subtotal td{ font-weight:700; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); }
  table.calc tbody tr.total td{ font-weight:700; border-top:2px solid var(--ink); border-bottom:2px solid var(--ink); }
  table.calc tbody tr.grand td{ font-weight:800; color:var(--teal); font-size:14px; }
  .mono{ font-family:var(--mono); }
  .cat-tag{ display:inline-block; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.3px; padding:1px 7px; border-radius:10px; margin-left:6px; }
  .cat-earnings{ background:var(--teal-soft); color:#0c554f; }
  .cat-excluded{ background:var(--amber-soft); color:#7a5011; }
  .cat-reimb{ background:var(--violet-soft); color:#4a3c85; }
  .cat-employer{ background:#eef1f3; color:#5b6b7a; }
  .cat-benefit{ background:#e6f0fa; color:#2b5c8a; }

  .kpis{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr); gap:12px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  @media (max-width: 700px){ .kpis{ grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);} }
  .kpi{ background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; padding:13px 15px; }
  .kpi .label{ font-size:10.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; color:var(--ink-soft); font-weight:700; }
  .kpi .value{ font-size:19px; font-weight:800; color:var(--navy); margin-top:4px; }
  .kpi .value small{ font-size:11px; font-weight:600; color:var(--ink-soft); }

  .toolbar{ display:flex; gap:10px; align-items:center; margin-bottom:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .toolbar input[type=text]{ max-width:280px; }

  table.db{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:13px; background:var(--card); border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:10px; overflow:hidden; }
  table.db th{ background:#eef2f5; text-align:left; padding:9px 11px; font-size:10.5px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; color:var(--ink-soft); border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  table.db td{ padding:9px 11px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); vertical-align:middle; }
  table.db tr:last-child td{ border-bottom:none; }
  table.db tr:hover td{ background:#fafbfc; }
  .pill{ display:inline-block; padding:2px 9px; border-radius:20px; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; }
  .pill.y{ background:var(--teal-soft); color:#0c554f; } .pill.n{ background:#eef1f3; color:#5b6b7a; }
  .empty{ text-align:center; color:var(--ink-soft); padding:50px 20px; background:var(--card); border:1px dashed var(--line); border-radius:10px; }

  .modal-bg{ position:fixed; inset:0; background:rgba(15,25,35,.55); display:none; align-items:flex-start; justify-content:center; padding:40px 16px; overflow:auto; z-index:50; }
  .modal-bg.show{ display:flex; }
  .modal{ background:#fff; border-radius:12px; max-width:760px; width:100%; padding:24px 26px; }
  .modal h3{ margin:0 0 4px; font-size:16px; } .modal .modal-sub{ color:var(--ink-soft); font-size:12px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .modal-close{ float:right; }

  footer.note{ text-align:center; color:#93a0ac; font-size:11.5px; margin-top:30px; }
  .assumption{ font-size:11px; color:#8592a0; margin-top:10px; border-top:1px dashed var(--line); padding-top:10px; }

  table.mw{ width:100%; border-collapse:collapse; font-size:12.5px; }
  table.mw th{ background:#eef2f5; padding:7px 8px; font-size:10px; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.3px; color:var(--ink-soft); text-align:left; position:sticky; top:0; }
  table.mw td{ padding:4px 6px; border-bottom:1px solid var(--line); }
  table.mw input{ padding:5px 6px; font-size:12.5px; }
  table.mw tr:hover td{ background:#fafbfc; }
  .mw-scroll{ max-height:560px; overflow:auto; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; }

  .comp-card{ border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:12px 14px; margin-bottom:10px; background:#fbfcfd; position:relative; }
  .comp-head{ display:flex; gap:8px; align-items:center; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .comp-head input[type=text]{ font-weight:700; min-width:160px; flex:1; }
  .comp-head select{ max-width:190px; }
  .comp-actions{ display:flex; gap:5px; margin-left:auto; }
  .comp-fields{ display:grid; grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(150px,1fr)); gap:8px 12px; margin-top:10px; }
  .comp-fields label{ margin:0 0 3px; }
  .comp-note{ font-size:11px; color:#8592a0; margin-top:8px; }
  .order-badge{ display:inline-flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; width:20px; height:20px; border-radius:5px; background:var(--navy); color:#fff; font-size:11px; font-weight:700; margin-right:2px;}
  .config-actions{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin-bottom:14px; flex-wrap:wrap; }
  .formula-box{ background:#f7f9fa; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:8px; padding:12px 14px; font-size:12.5px; margin-bottom:16px; }
  .formula-box code{ background:#fff; border:1px solid var(--line); border-radius:4px; padding:1px 6px; font-family:var(--mono); font-size:12px; }
  .group-label{ font-size:11px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink-soft); text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; margin:16px 0 8px; }
  .group-label:first-child{ margin-top:0; }

  /* Login gate */
  #loginScreen{ position:fixed; inset:0; background:linear-gradient(160deg,#152a45,#1f3a5f); display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; z-index:100; padding:20px; }
  .login-card{ background:#fff; border-radius:14px; padding:36px 34px; width:100%; max-width:380px; box-shadow:0 20px 60px rgba(0,0,0,.35); }
  .login-card h2{ font-size:18px; margin:0 0 4px; color:var(--ink); border:none; padding:0; text-transform:none; letter-spacing:0; }
  .login-card .login-sub{ font-size:12.5px; color:var(--ink-soft); margin-bottom:20px; }
  .login-card label{ margin-top:14px; }
  .role-toggle{ display:flex; gap:8px; margin-top:6px; }
  .role-toggle button{ flex:1; padding:9px; border-radius:6px; border:1px solid var(--line); background:#fbfcfd; font-size:12.5px; font-weight:700; color:var(--ink-soft); cursor:pointer; }
  .role-toggle button.active{ background:var(--navy-deep); color:#fff; border-color:var(--navy-deep); }
  .login-error{ color:var(--red); font-size:12px; margin-top:10px; min-height:16px; }
  .login-card .btn{ width:100%; margin-top:16px; padding:11px; font-size:13px; }
  .role-pill{ font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:.4px; padding:3px 10px; border-radius:20px; background:rgba(255,255,255,.15); color:#fff; margin-left:10px; }
  .logout-btn{ background:transparent; border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.3); color:#dbe4ee; padding:7px 12px; border-radius:6px; font-size:12px; font-weight:600; cursor:pointer; }
  .logout-btn:hover{ background:rgba(255,255,255,.1); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div id="loginScreen">
  <div class="login-card">
    <h2>Salary Structure &amp; Candidate Database</h2>
    <div class="login-sub">Sign in to continue</div>
    <label>I am logging in as</label>
    <div class="role-toggle">
      <button type="button" id="roleBtnUser" class="active" onclick="setLoginRole('user')">User</button>
      <button type="button" id="roleBtnAdmin" onclick="setLoginRole('admin')">Admin</button>
    </div>
    <label for="loginPassword">Access Code</label>
    <input type="password" id="loginPassword" placeholder="Enter access code" onkeydown="if(event.key==='Enter') attemptLogin()">
    <div class="login-error" id="loginError"></div>
    <button class="btn" id="loginSubmitBtn" onclick="attemptLogin()" disabled>Connecting…</button>
    <div class="hint" style="margin-top:14px;">Users can run the calculator and manage the candidate database. Admins can additionally edit Minimum Wages and Formulas.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div id="appRoot" style="display:none;">
<header class="app-header">
  <div>
    <h1>Salary Structure &amp; Candidate Database <span class="role-pill" id="roleBadge"></span></h1>
    <div class="sub">CTC calculator segregated by Wage-Code component category</div>
  </div>
  <nav class="tabs">
    <button id="tabBtnCalc" class="active" onclick="showPage('calc')">Salary Calculator</button>
    <button id="tabBtnMw" onclick="showPage('mw')">Minimum Wages</button>
    <button id="tabBtnComp" onclick="showPage('comp')">Components &amp; Formulas</button>
    <button id="tabBtnDb" onclick="showPage('db')">Candidate Database</button>
    <button class="logout-btn" onclick="logout()">Log out</button>
  </nav>
</header>

<main>

  <!-- ===================== PAGE 1: CALCULATOR ===================== -->
  <section id="page-calc" class="page active">
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Wage &amp; Structure Inputs</h2>
          <label>State / Zone</label>
          <select id="inState"></select>
          <label>Employee Category</label>
          <select id="inCategory">
            <option value="UNSKILLED">Unskilled</option>
            <option value="SEMISKILLED">Semi-Skilled</option>
            <option value="SKILLED" selected>Skilled</option>
            <option value="HIGHLYSKILLED">Highly Skilled</option>
          </select>
          <div class="row2">
            <div><label>PF Applicability</label><select id="inPF"><option value="Y" selected>Yes</option><option value="N">No</option></select></div>
            <div><label>Metro / Non-Metro</label><select id="inMetro"><option value="Y">Metro</option><option value="N" selected>Non-Metro</option></select></div>
          </div>
          <label>PF Wage Basis</label>
          <select id="inPFBasis">
            <option value="15K" selected>Capped at PF ceiling</option>
            <option value="ACTUAL">On actual Basic (no ceiling)</option>
          </select>
          <label>Employee Type</label>
          <select id="inEmpType">
            <option value="REGULAR" selected>Regular Employee</option>
            <option value="CONSULTANT">Consultant / Retainer</option>
          </select>
          <div class="row2">
            <div><label>Current Wage (₹ / month)</label><input type="number" id="inWage" value="50000" min="0" step="500"></div>
            <div><label>Hike / Increment (%)</label><input type="number" id="inHike" value="0" min="0" step="0.5"></div>
          </div>
          <label>Incentive / PLB (%)</label>
          <input type="number" id="inIncentive" value="0" min="0" step="0.5">
          <div class="hint" id="incentiveBaseHint">Added on top of CTC — not part of the statutory Remuneration formula.</div>
        </div>

        <div class="card">
          <h2>Candidate Details <span style="font-weight:400;color:#8592a0;">(optional — for saving)</span></h2>
          <label>Employee Name</label>
          <input type="text" id="inName" placeholder="e.g. Rahul Sharma">
          <div class="row2">
            <div><label>Department</label><input type="text" id="inDept" placeholder="e.g. Operations"></div>
            <div><label>Designation</label><input type="text" id="inDesig" placeholder="e.g. Executive"></div>
          </div>
          <div class="row2">
            <div><label>Job Grade</label><input type="text" id="inGrade" placeholder="e.g. G3"></div>
            <div><label>Date of Joining</label><input type="date" id="inDoj"></div>
          </div>
          <div style="margin-top:16px;"><button class="btn" onclick="saveCandidate()">Save to Candidate Database</button></div>
          <div id="saveMsg" class="hint" style="margin-top:8px;"></div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div>
        <div id="mwBanner"></div>
        <div class="kpis">
          <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Total Remuneration</div><div class="value" id="kpiR">–</div></div>
          <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Basic</div><div class="value" id="kpiBasic">–</div></div>
          <div class="kpi"><div class="label">CTC</div><div class="value" id="kpiCTC">–</div></div>
          <div class="kpi"><div class="label">Cash in Hand (CIH)</div><div class="value" id="kpiCIH">–</div></div>
        </div>
        <div class="formula-box">
          <b>Formula used:</b><br>
          <code>Basic</code> = higher of (Basic % × Remuneration) or (State Minimum Wage)<br>
          <code>Remuneration</code> = Basic + Earnings + Excluded Allowance + Reimbursements + Employer PF<br>
          <code>CTC</code> = Remuneration + Employer ESI + Gratuity + Benefits<br>
          <code>Cash in Hand (CIH)</code> = Remuneration − Employer PF − Employee PF − Employee ESI
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <h2>Salary Breakup</h2>
          <table class="calc" id="breakupTable">
            <thead><tr><th>Component</th><th>Monthly (₹)</th><th>Annual (₹)</th></tr></thead>
            <tbody id="breakupBody"></tbody>
          </table>
          <div class="assumption">
            Components are grouped exactly as in your reference workbook: <b>Earnings</b> (wage-code Included),
            <b>Excluded Allowance</b> (statutory exclusions like HRA/LTA/Bonus, plus the Residual Allowance balancing
            figure), <b>Reimbursements</b>, <b>Employer Contributions</b>, and <b>Benefits</b>. Every component
            still draws from the same wage-balance waterfall so nothing is double-counted — edit categories, formulas
            and amounts under <b>Components &amp; Formulas</b>.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== PAGE 2: MINIMUM WAGES ===================== -->
  <section id="page-mw" class="page">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>State-wise Minimum Wages
        <span style="font-weight:400;"><button class="btn small" onclick="addMwRow()">+ Add State</button></span>
      </h2>
      <div class="config-actions">
        <button class="btn" onclick="saveMwTable()">Save Changes</button>
        <button class="btn secondary" onclick="resetMwTable()">Reset to Original Data</button>
        <input type="text" id="mwSearch" placeholder="Filter states…" style="max-width:220px;" oninput="renderMwEditor()">
      </div>
      <div class="mw-scroll">
        <table class="mw">
          <thead><tr>
            <th style="min-width:220px;">State / Zone</th>
            <th>Unskilled (₹)</th><th>Semi-Skilled (₹)</th><th>Skilled (₹)</th><th>Highly Skilled (₹)</th><th></th>
          </tr></thead>
          <tbody id="mwEditorBody"></tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
      <div id="mwSaveMsg" class="hint" style="margin-top:10px;"></div>
      <div class="assumption">Leave a category cell blank if that state hasn't published a rate for it — the calculator will fall back to Basic % of Remuneration in that case.</div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== PAGE 3: COMPONENTS & FORMULAS ===================== -->
  <section id="page-comp" class="page">
    <div class="card">
      <h2>Basic, PF, Bonus, ESI &amp; Gratuity Settings</h2>
      <div class="config-actions">
        <button class="btn" onclick="saveComponentConfig()">Save Changes</button>
        <button class="btn secondary" onclick="resetComponentConfig()">Reset to Original Formulas</button>
      </div>
      <div class="row3">
        <div><label>Basic Wage % of Remuneration</label><input type="number" id="cfgBasicPercent" step="0.5"></div>
        <div><label>PF Ceiling (₹)</label><input type="number" id="cfgPfCeiling" step="500"></div>
        <div><label>Incentive/PLB calculated on</label>
          <select id="cfgIncentiveBase"><option value="remuneration">Remuneration</option><option value="basic">Basic</option><option value="ctc">CTC</option></select>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row3" style="margin-top:4px;">
        <div><label>Employer PF %</label><input type="number" id="cfgEmployerPF" step="0.5"></div>
        <div><label>Employee PF %</label><input type="number" id="cfgEmployeePF" step="0.5"></div>
        <div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row3" style="margin-top:4px;">
        <div><label>Bonus applies if Basic ≤ (₹)</label><input type="number" id="cfgBonusThreshold" step="500"></div>
        <div><label>Statutory Bonus %</label><input type="number" id="cfgBonusPercent" step="0.01"></div>
        <div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row3" style="margin-top:4px;">
        <div><label>Employer ESI applies if Basic ≤ (₹)</label><input type="number" id="cfgErEsicThreshold" step="500"></div>
        <div><label>Employer ESI % (of Basic)</label><input type="number" id="cfgErEsicPercent" step="0.05"></div>
        <div><label>Gratuity % (of Basic)</label><input type="number" id="cfgGratuity" step="0.01"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="row3" style="margin-top:4px;">
        <div><label>Employee ESI applies if Basic &lt; (₹)</label><input type="number" id="cfgEeEsicThreshold" step="500"></div>
        <div><label>Employee ESI % (of Basic)</label><input type="number" id="cfgEeEsicPercent" step="0.05"></div>
        <div></div>
      </div>
      <div class="hint">Employer/Employee ESI here follows your reference workbook's rule of being based on Basic (not Gross). Employee PF/ESI are this tool's own addition, needed to compute Cash in Hand — mirrored off the Employer PF/ESI rules; adjust if your policy differs.</div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Salary Components — Waterfall <span style="font-weight:400;"><button class="btn small" onclick="addEarning()">+ Add Component</button></span></h2>
      <div class="hint" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Computed in order after Basic, Employer PF and Bonus are set aside from Remuneration. Each component is tagged with its Wage-Code category (Earnings / Excluded Allowance / Reimbursement) — that tag drives which section it appears in on the Salary Calculator. Use ↑↓ to reorder — order affects how much balance is left for later components. Residual Allowance should normally stay last.</div>
      <div id="earningsList"></div>
    </div>

    <div class="card">
      <h2>Benefits — Fixed Additions to CTC <span style="font-weight:400;"><button class="btn small" onclick="addBenefit()">+ Add Benefit</button></span></h2>
      <div class="hint" style="margin-bottom:10px;">Company-provided benefits (insurance, meal cards, accommodation, transport, etc.) added directly to CTC — these are not part of Remuneration and are not paid out as cash.</div>
      <div id="benefitsList"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- ===================== PAGE 4: CANDIDATE DATABASE ===================== -->
  <section id="page-db" class="page">
    <div class="toolbar">
      <input type="text" id="dbSearch" placeholder="Search name, department, designation, state…" oninput="renderDb()">
      <select id="dbSort" onchange="renderDb()">
